{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find object and approach it, take and process its properties, perform specific task if successful, otherwise scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectWithinRange    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    />",
